Module parity.workflow.multistep.

Rule runFlow, produce. It performs io:
  workflow:
    step prepare:
      Return ok of 1.

    step charge depends on ["prepare"]:
      Return ok of 2.

    step notify depends on ["charge"]:
      Return ok of 3.

    retry:
      max attempts: 3.
      backoff: linear.

    timeout: 30 seconds.
  .
